  "articleBody": "A kitchen backsplash installation is easiest to price and schedule when the wall condition, tile material, outlet locations, countertop relationship, and desired coverage are decided together. A qualified remodeling team can evaluate the existing surface, coordinate related electrical or cabinet work, prepare a clear scope, and install a finish suited to daily cooking and cleaning.",
